{"Date": "02/26/2020", "Record Number": "ZCHO2020-0060", "Record Type": "Zoning Certificate Low Impact Home Occupation", "Description": "Wellness consulting and custom meditation products. This business will not have any brick-and-mortar presence in Berkeley. I will organize the business from my home address, but will work with clients and customers at other locations. 1) Wellness consulting: I will consult for individuals and organizations to improve their wellness practices, and I will offer meditation workshops. I will partner with yoga studios so that I have venues to offer my workshops. 2) Custom meditation products: I will hand-craft custom supplies for meditation including beaded necklaces, incense holders, and essential oil candles. I will participate in local craft fairs so that I have venues to offer my products. Therefore I am requesting that my home address be authorized for office use only.", "Project Name": "Involution Arts", "Status": "Approved", "Action": "", "Expiration Date": "", "Short Notes": "", "_cells": ["", "02/26/2020", "ZCHO2020-0060", "Zoning Certificate Low Impact Home Occupation", "Wellness consulting and custom meditation products. This business will not have any brick-and-mortar presence in Berkeley. I will organize the business from my home address, but will work with clients and customers at other locations. 1) Wellness consulting: I will consult for individuals and organizations to improve their wellness practices, and I will offer meditation workshops. I will partner with yoga studios so that I have venues to offer my workshops. 2) Custom meditation products: I will hand-craft custom supplies for meditation including beaded necklaces, incense holders, and essential oil candles. I will participate in local craft fairs so that I have venues to offer my products. Therefore I am requesting that my home address be authorized for office use only.", "Involution Arts", "Approved", "", "", "", "1418 SPRUCE St, BERKELEY CA 94709"], "capdetail_href": "/BERKELEY/Cap/CapDetail.aspx?Module=Planning&TabName=Planning&capID1=20PLN&capID2=00000&capID3=00212&agencyCode=BERKELEY&IsToShowInspection="}
